    {
      "id": "claim_dcc0df2d8d304d71876fefca31c6744e",
      "statement": "The root Containerfile uses a digest-pinned UBI9 base and nine stages — tools-base, sre-tools, claude-builder, opencode-builder, codex-builder, pi-builder, search-builder, tmux-builder, and final — where only final ships and copies its selected outputs from the eight builder stages; sre-tools and the four coding-agent builders depend on tools-base while tmux-builder depends only on BASE_IMAGE, so stages 2-8 can build in parallel under BuildKit/podman --layers once their dependencies are ready. The root Makefile's build-amd64/build-arm64 targets build separate AMD64/ARM64 images with Podman and the manifest target assembles their tags into one multi-architecture manifest list.",
