    {
      "id": "claim_7844cb54c13742fa9472237d9e0148c0",
      "statement": "Before launching work, the entrypoint requires OCM and kubeconfig paths to be task-scoped mounts that are not EFS/NFS-backed (verify_credential_mounts), prepares them with sre:sre ownership and mode 0700 (initialize_credential_mounts) — both run through the startup_step helper so PID 1 keeps handling signals even if a step blocks on EFS — then runs the requested process as sre in the background (CHILD_PID) while the root shell blocks on wait to retain signal handling.",
